  "instructions": [
    "Heat the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chicken thighs and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the malt syrup, fish sauce, soy sauce, ginger, and garlic to the vessel.",
    "Pour in the water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional scallions if desired.",
    "Cook poultry to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F before serving."
